-- Starter pages for the Games book: 159 games from the folders kept by
-- Belmont Scouts' Cub and Scout sections, rewritten in the book's own words
-- and credited on every page. Every section goes in switched off (see the games
-- migration), so none of this shows until a leader has checked it. Open flame,
-- contact and water games in particular want a second pair of eyes. Then:
--   update public.kinds set enabled = true where book = 'games';
-- The same content, easier to edit by hand, is in games.json.
on conflict (slug) do update set
  title = excluded.title, tag = excluded.tag, kind = excluded.kind,
  category_label = excluded.category_label, tune = excluded.tune,
  blocks = excluded.blocks, sort_order = excluded.sort_order;
